        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Panic Bar Strike Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStrike plate for panic devices. For use with Global Door Controls Touch Bar Rim <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\">Exit Device TH1100EDTBAR</a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-stainless-steel-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbarss\">Exit Device TH1100EDTBARSS</a>, <a href=\"/products/dark-bronze-exit-door-locks-global-ed-501-du\">Exit Device ED-501-DU</a>,  <a href=\"/products/exit-door-locks-global-ed-501-al\">Exit Device ED-501-AL</a> and <a href=\"/products/touch-bar-rim-exit-device-with-alarm-glo-ed-501alarm-al\">Alarm Exit Device ED-501ALARM-AL</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nStrike plate kit includes a 1/8\" thick shim plate. Slotted screw holes for adjustment.  Fixed screw hole locks the strike in place.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global ED-KITR Panic Device Strike Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Roller Strike Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Shim Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws. \r\n</p>",
